OL,3,GNEWSAPutin not invited to G20 summit in
OL,4,AManchester, says Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said
OL,7,FVladimir Putin is not invited to the
OL,8,FG20 summit in Manchester.
OL,10,FAsked whether the Russian president
OL,11,Fwould be invited to the annual meeting,
OL,12,Fwhich the UK is hosting in November
OL,13,F2027, Burnham said "no" because of
OL,14,Fsanctions against the Kremlin.
OL,16,FThe UK has a longstanding policy not to
OL,17,Fhave direct, bilateral engagement with
OL,18,FRussian ministers since Russia invaded
OL,19,FUkraine in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
