OL,3,GNEWSAPutin not invited to G20 summit in
OL,4,AManchester, says Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut US president Donald Trump has
OL,7,Fsparked controversy by inviting Putin
OL,8,Fto this year's G20, which he will host
OL,9,Fin Miami in December. The Kremlin has
OL,10,Fnot yet said whether Putin will attend.
